<section>
  <div class="module-head">
    <div><div class="module-kicker">CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE</div><h1>Manajemen Pelanggan</h1><p>Kelola pelanggan, paket, site, status billing, dan kondisi jaringan dari satu layar.</p></div>
    <div class="module-actions customer-actions"><a class="btn-tech" href="/customers/template.xlsx"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-spreadsheet"></i>Template XLSX</a><% if(user?.role==='admin'){ %><button class="btn-tech" type="button" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#customerImportModal"><i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up-fill"></i>Import XLSX</button><form method="post" action="/customers/sync-pppoe" onsubmit="return confirm('Sinkronkan pelanggan aktif dengan PPPoE MikroTik berdasarkan Site dan username yang sama?')"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="site" value="<%= filters.site %>"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/customers?site=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.site) %>&status=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.status) %>&network=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.network) %>"><button class="btn-tech sync"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i>Sinkron PPPoE<%= filters.site?' · '+filters.site:'' %></button></form><% } %><a class="btn-tech" href="/customers/export.xlsx?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.q) %>&site=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.site) %>&cluster=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.cluster) %>&status=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.status) %>&network=<%= encodeURIComponent(filters.network) %>"><i class="bi bi-download"></i>Export XLSX</a><a class="btn-tech primary" href="/customers/new"><i class="bi bi-person-plus-fill"></i>Tambah Pelanggan</a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="metric-grid">
    <article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-top"><span class="metric-label">Total Pelanggan</span><span class="metric-icon"><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i></span></div><strong><%= Number(stats.total||0) %></strong><small>Seluruh data pelanggan</small></article>
    <article class="metric-card green"><div class="metric-top"><span class="metric-label">Pelanggan Aktif</span><span class="metric-icon"><i class="bi bi-person-check-fill"></i></span></div><strong><%= Number(stats.active||0) %></strong><small>Service aktif</small></article>
    <article class="metric-card orange"><div class="metric-top"><span class="metric-label">Suspended</span><span class="metric-icon"><i class="bi bi-pause-circle-fill"></i></span></div><strong><%= Number(stats.suspended||0) %></strong><small>Nonaktif sementara</small></article>
    <article class="metric-card red"><div class="metric-top"><span class="metric-label">Terisolir</span><span class="metric-icon"><i class="bi bi-wifi-off"></i></span></div><strong><%= Number(stats.isolated||0) %></strong><small>Network isolation</small></article>
  </div>

  <div class="pppoe-sync-strip"><div><span class="pppoe-sync-icon"><i class="bi bi-router-fill"></i></span><span><strong>Mode Sinkron PPPoE per Site</strong><small>Username hanya dipasangkan ke router pada Site yang sama; data duplikat tidak diubah otomatis.</small></span></div><div><span><b><%= Number(stats.pppoe_linked||0) %></b><small>Terhubung</small></span><span class="warn"><b><%= Number(stats.pppoe_unlinked||0) %></b><small>Perlu sinkron</small></span></div></div>

  <form class="filter-card" method="get">
    <div class="filter-grid">
      <div class="filter-group"><label>PENCARIAN</label><input class="form-control" name="q" value="<%= filters.q %>" placeholder="ID, nama, telepon, alamat, site, cluster..."></div>
      <div class="filter-group"><label>SITE / POP</label><select class="form-select" name="site"><option value="">Semua Site</option><% sites.forEach(s=>{ %><option value="<%= s.code %>" <%= filters.site===s.code?'selected':'' %>><%= s.code %> · <%= s.name %></option><% }) %></select></div>
      <div class="filter-group"><label>CLUSTER / ODP</label><select class="form-select" name="cluster"><option value="">Semua Cluster</option><% clusters.forEach(c=>{ %><option value="<%= c.id %>" <%= String(filters.cluster)===String(c.id)?'selected':'' %>><%= c.site_code %> · <%= c.name %></option><% }) %></select></div>
      <div class="filter-group"><label>STATUS PELANGGAN</label><select class="form-select" name="status"><option value="">Semua Status</option><option value="active" <%= filters.status==='active'?'selected':'' %>>Aktif</option><option value="inactive" <%= filters.status==='inactive'?'selected':'' %>>Tidak Aktif</option><option value="suspended" <%= filters.status==='suspended'?'selected':'' %>>Suspended</option><option value="terminated" <%= filters.status==='terminated'?'selected':'' %>>Berhenti</option></select></div>
      <div class="filter-group"><label>STATUS PPPoE</label><select class="form-select" name="network"><option value="">Semua Network</option><option value="online" <%= filters.network==='online'?'selected':'' %>>Online</option><option value="problem" <%= filters.network==='problem'?'selected':'' %>>Bermasalah (Offline + Router)</option><option value="offline" <%= filters.network==='offline'?'selected':'' %>>Offline</option><option value="isolated" <%= filters.network==='isolated'?'selected':'' %>>Terisolir</option><option value="router_unreachable" <%= filters.network==='router_unreachable'?'selected':'' %>>Router Tidak Terjangkau</option><option value="unlinked" <%= filters.network==='unlinked'?'selected':'' %>>Belum Terhubung PPPoE</option></select></div>
      <div class="filter-group d-flex align-items-end gap-2"><button class="btn-tech primary flex-fill"><i class="bi bi-funnel-fill"></i>Terapkan Filter</button><a class="btn-tech" href="/customers"><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i></a></div>
    </div>
  </form>

  <div class="data-card action-safe-card">
    <div class="data-card-head"><div><h3>Database Pelanggan</h3><small><%= customers.length %> data ditemukan</small></div><div class="toolbar-right"><span class="status-badge purple"><%= customers.length %> rows</span></div></div>
    <div class="table-responsive action-safe-table">
      <table class="app-table"><thead><tr><th>Customer</th><th>Sales</th><th>Site / Cluster</th><th>Paket</th><th>Harga Paket</th><th>PPPoE</th><th>Billing</th><th>Network</th><th>Kontak</th><th class="text-center">Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <% customers.forEach(c=>{ const wa=String(c.phone||'').replace(/\D/g,'').replace(/^0/,'62').replace(/^8/,'628'); %><tr>
        <td><a class="cell-main text-decoration-none" href="/customers/<%= c.id %>"><%= c.name %></a><span class="cell-sub"><%= c.customer_code %></span></td>
        <td><span class="cell-main"><%= c.sales_name || 'Direct' %></span><span class="cell-sub"><%= c.sales_code || 'Tanpa sales' %></span></td>
        <td><span class="cell-main"><%= c.site_code %></span><span class="cell-sub"><%= c.cluster_name || 'Belum di-cluster' %></span></td>
        <td><span class="cell-main"><%= c.package_name %></span><span class="cell-sub"><%= c.speed_label || 'Paket Internet' %></span></td>
        <td class="money"><%= formatRupiah(c.package_price) %><span class="cell-sub">/ bulan</span></td>
        <td><span class="cell-main"><%= c.pppoe_username || 'Belum diisi' %></span><span class="cell-sub"><%= c.router_name ? c.router_name+' · '+c.site_code : 'Belum terhubung ke router Site' %></span></td>
        <td><span class="status-badge <%= c.billing_status==='paid'?'green':c.billing_status==='overdue'?'red':'orange' %>"><%= c.billing_status %></span></td>
        <td><span class="status-badge <%= c.network_status==='online'?'green':c.network_status==='isolated'?'red':'gray' %>"><%= c.network_status %></span></td>
        <td><% if(wa.length>=9){ %><a class="customer-wa-link" href="https://wa.me/<%= wa %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Buka WhatsApp <%= c.name %>"><i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i><span><%= c.phone %></span></a><% }else{ %><span class="cell-main">-</span><% } %><span class="wa-validation-badge <%= c.whatsapp_status||'unverified' %>"><i class="bi <%= c.whatsapp_status==='valid'?'bi-patch-check-fill':c.whatsapp_status==='invalid'?'bi-exclamation-octagon-fill':'bi-question-circle-fill' %>"></i><%= c.whatsapp_status==='valid'?'WA tervalidasi':c.whatsapp_status==='invalid'?'Nomor tidak valid':'Belum divalidasi' %></span><span class="cell-sub"><%= c.address || '-' %></span></td>
        <td class="text-center customer-action-cell">
          <button class="action-menu action-menu-labeled" type="button" data-action-popover-target="customerAction<%= c.id %>" aria-label="Buka tindakan pelanggan <%= c.name %>"><i class="bi bi-three-dots-vertical"></i><span>Aksi</span></button>
          <div class="ink-action-popover" id="customerAction<%= c.id %>" hidden>
            <div class="ink-action-popover-head"><div><small>PELANGGAN</small><strong><%= c.name %></strong><span><%= c.customer_code %> · <%= c.site_code %><%= c.cluster_name?' · '+c.cluster_name:'' %></span></div></div>
            <div class="ink-action-popover-body">
              <a class="ink-action-item compact" href="/customers/<%= c.id %>"><i class="bi bi-person-vcard"></i><span><b>Detail Pelanggan</b><small>Lihat profil lengkap pelanggan</small></span></a>
              <a class="ink-action-item compact" href="/customers/<%= c.id %>/edit"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i><span><b>Edit</b><small>Perbarui data pelanggan</small></span></a>
              <% if(c.open_invoice_id){ %><a class="ink-action-item compact success" href="/payments?invoice_id=<%= c.open_invoice_id %>"><i class="bi bi-wallet2"></i><span><b>Pembayaran</b><small>Catat pembayaran tagihan aktif</small></span></a><% }else{ %><a class="ink-action-item compact" href="/invoices?customer=<%= c.id %>"><i class="bi bi-receipt"></i><span><b>Cek Tagihan</b><small>Lihat daftar tagihan pelanggan</small></span></a><% } %>
              <a class="ink-action-item compact" href="/payments?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(c.customer_code) %>"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i><span><b>Cek Pembayaran</b><small>Riwayat transaksi pelanggan</small></span></a>
              <a class="ink-action-item compact" href="/invoices?customer=<%= c.id %>"><i class="bi bi-receipt-cutoff"></i><span><b>Rincian Tagihan</b><small>Invoice dan status pembayaran</small></span></a>
              <% if(c.pppoe_username&&c.router_id){ %><form method="post" action="/network/<%= c.id %>/check"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="ink-action-item compact" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i><span><b>Sinkron Status PPPoE</b><small>Cek status langsung ke router <%= c.site_code %></small></span></button></form><% } %>
              <% if(wa.length>=9){ %><a class="ink-action-item compact success" href="https://wa.me/<%= wa %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i><span><b>WhatsApp</b><small>Hubungi pelanggan</small></span></a><% } %>
              <% if(isAdmin){ %><div class="ink-action-separator"></div><div class="wa-validation-actions"><small>VALIDASI WHATSAPP</small><form method="post" action="/customers/<%= c.id %>/whatsapp-status" onsubmit="return confirm('Tandai nomor WhatsApp <%= c.name %> sebagai valid? Pastikan chat WhatsApp sudah berhasil dibuka.')"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="status" value="valid"><button class="ink-action-item compact success" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill"></i><span><b>Tandai Valid</b><small>Simpan hasil pengecekan nomor</small></span></button></form><form method="post" action="/customers/<%= c.id %>/whatsapp-status"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="status" value="invalid"><button class="ink-action-item compact danger" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-octagon"></i><span><b>Tandai Tidak Valid</b><small>Nomor tidak terhubung ke WhatsApp</small></span></button></form></div><% } %>
              <% if(user.role==='admin' && c.customer_status!=='terminated'){ %><div class="ink-action-separator"></div><form method="post" action="/customers/<%= c.id %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('Arsipkan pelanggan ini? Riwayat tagihan dan pembayaran tetap disimpan.')"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="ink-action-item compact danger" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-archive"></i><span><b>Hapus / Arsipkan</b><small>Riwayat keuangan tetap disimpan</small></span></button></form><% } %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr><% }) %>
      <% if(!customers.length){ %><tr><td colspan="10"><div class="empty-state"><i class="bi bi-people"></i><strong>Data pelanggan tidak ditemukan</strong><small>Coba ubah filter atau tambahkan pelanggan baru.</small></div></td></tr><% } %>
      </tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="modal fade" id="customerImportModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-centered">
    <form class="modal-content customer-import-modal" method="post" action="/customers/import" enctype="multipart/form-data">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <div><div class="module-kicker">IMPORT PELANGGAN</div><h5 class="modal-title">Import Pelanggan dari Excel</h5><small class="text-secondary">Customer ID dibuat otomatis oleh sistem.</small></div>
        <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="customer-import-console">
          <div class="customer-import-topbar">
            <label class="customer-import-file">
              <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-spreadsheet-fill"></i>
              <input type="file" name="customer_file" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" required>
              <span><b>Pilih file .xlsx</b><small data-file-label>Belum ada file dipilih</small></span>
            </label>
            <button class="btn-tech primary" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up-fill"></i>Import</button>
            <a class="btn-tech customer-template-download" href="/customers/template.xlsx"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-arrow-down"></i>Download Format Import</a>
          </div>
          <div class="customer-import-warning">
            <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Sebelum melakukan import</strong>
              <ul>
                <li>Pastikan <a href="/sites" target="_blank">Site / POP</a> sudah dibuat.</li>
                <li>Pastikan <a href="/packages" target="_blank">Paket Internet</a> sudah dibuat dan sesuai dengan Site pelanggan.</li>
                <li>Jika mengisi Cluster / Router, data tersebut harus sudah ada pada Site yang sama.</li>
                <li>Jangan menambahkan kolom Customer ID. Sistem generate otomatis, contoh <b>KRW-15-001</b>.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="customer-import-required">
            <div class="customer-import-required-head"><span>KOLOM WAJIB</span><small>Jika salah satu kosong, import seluruh file dibatalkan.</small></div>
            <div class="customer-import-chip-grid">
              <% ['Nama','Site','Paket Internet','Alamat','Whatsapp','Tanggal Instalasi','Tanggal Jatuh Tempo'].forEach(x=>{ %><span><i class="bi bi-asterisk"></i><%= x %></span><% }) %>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="customer-import-rules">
            <div><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i><span><b>Site + Paket harus cocok</b><small>Paket site-specific tidak dapat digunakan di Site lain. Lihat sheet REFERENSI pada template.</small></span></div>
            <div><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><span><b>Validasi atomik</b><small>Semua baris diperiksa dulu. Satu error = tidak ada data setengah masuk.</small></span></div>
            <div><i class="bi bi-hash"></i><span><b>Customer ID otomatis</b><small>Format Site + Jatuh Tempo + nomor urut, tanpa risiko duplikat dari import normal.</small></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <span class="customer-import-footer-note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>Format yang disarankan: template terbaru dari tombol Download Format Import.</span>
        <button class="btn-tech" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Batal</button>
        <button class="btn-tech primary" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i>Validasi & Import</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
